        "app_name": "TagWeaver",
        "platform": "android",
        "rating": "5",
        "review_kind": "review",
        "title": "",
        "body": "[UPDATED] This is an extremely good tag editor. I like how this app is so simple, can only access files you give permission to, has ability to load AND export album covers and has no ads but only one in app purchase. I had an issue with being unable to change flac album covers, but the dev fixed it after my review. Although this app can only edit mp3 and flac files, it works great for what it advertises itself as.",
        "reviewer_language": "en",
        "territory": "",
        "app_version": "2.3.0",
        "created_at": "2026-08-24T21:45:11Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-08-29T19:53:11Z",
        "developer_reply": "Thank you so much for updating your review! Your detailed report about the FLAC cover art issue really helped us track it down and get it fixed. We’re very glad to hear TagWeaver is working well for you now. Thanks again for taking the time to report the issue, test the fix, and update your review — we really appreciate it!",
        "reply_updated_at": "2026-08-30T10:43:33Z",
        "status": "replied",
        "synced_at": "2026-09-18T04:52:36+00:00"
      },
      "reason": "superseded_alias",
      "canonical_review_id": "873ee7f8-107e-4b31-8876-51d88b27fa5c",
      "checked_at": "2026-09-18T12:45:20+00:00",
      "archived_at": "2026-09-18T12:45:20+00:00"
    },
    {
      "review": {
        "review_id": "report-4ae4d00c5bb0eddb44faeede",
        "app_id": "APP-0002",
        "app_slug": "tagweaver",
        "app_name": "TagWeaver",
        "platform": "android",
        "rating": "5",
        "review_kind": "review",
        "title": "",
        "body": "EXACTLY WHAT I'VE BEEN LOOKING FOR!! Works perfectly, too! I've been wanting an android tagger that supports custom tags for AGES. I'm so happy to have finally found one! I can finally use Disc Subtitles without transferring files to my PC and back, lol. only criticism is the lack of FLAC support. I'd definitely like that in a newer update if possible. but gosh, I'm ecstatic to have found this!",
        "reviewer_language": "en",
        "territory": "",
        "app_version": "1.0.0",
        "created_at": "2026-03-25T08:34:21Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-03-25T08:34:21Z",
        "developer_reply": "Thanks for the detailed feedback — really glad it’s helping your workflow. Custom tag support was a core focus for TagWeaver. FLAC is something we’re considering for a future version.",
        "reply_updated_at": "2026-04-02T13:03:27Z",
        "status": "replied",
        "synced_at": "2026-09-08T04:49:00+00:00"
