        "created_at": "2026-05-26T10:55:35Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-05-26T10:55:35Z",
        "developer_reply": "Thanks for the feedback. TagWeaver is currently designed as an MP3 tag editor, which is stated in the app title and description. Batch editing of multiple tracks is available through the Pro version, while the free version focuses on single-track editing. I appreciate the feedback and will continue improving the app experience and onboarding.",
