        "rating": "4",
        "review_kind": "review",
        "title": "",
        "body": "This is a great and simple app for modfying tags for your music files, although I am facing a bug where I am unable to change the cover art of a flac file (unable to save), while mp3's work perfectly.",
        "reviewer_language": "en",
        "territory": "",
        "app_version": "2.2.2",
        "created_at": "2026-08-24T21:45:11Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-08-24T21:45:11Z",
        "developer_reply": "Thanks for the kind words, and especially for letting us know about the FLAC cover art issue. We’re working on a fix now, and it should be patched very soon. Thanks for helping us make TagWeaver better!",
